# Full transcriptions are large (a whole-work run is ~100 MB) and regenerable
# with probe/run.sh. What is committed is probe/extract.py's output, which keeps
# the same shape and is what every probe here was actually run on.
out/*.json
!out/*.extract.json
# `identity_only.py` output is already only the identity layer — 228 KB for the
# whole of Beethoven 5 — and it is what every whole-work number here was
# computed from, so it is committed whole.
!out/whole-identity.json
